      "snippet": {
        "line": 125,
        "text": "compactIntegral χ M v f z := pastIntegral M v f z - χ z.1 • totalIntegral M v f z, with pastIntegral = ∫ u in Iic 0, f (z + (u, (M*u) • v)) and totalIntegral = ∫ u : ℝ, f (z + (u, (M*u) • v))"
      }
